{"id":"449704","name":"紫菜虾丸汤","author":"甜妈美食记","authorId":"11248778","desc":"","cover":"images/449704/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大虾","amount":"20只"},{"name":"紫菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蛋清","amount":"1个"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"2片"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/449704/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾仁放入搅拌机中，倒入蛋清。","img":"images/449704/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入淀粉，用绞肉机绞成虾泥。","img":"images/449704/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入适量盐顺时针搅打均匀。","img":"images/449704/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搓成虾球。","img":"images/449704/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中倒入适量清水，放入紫菜一起煮沸，放入姜片。","img":"images/449704/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮沸后放入虾丸。","img":"images/449704/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入少许盐，煮至虾丸漂浮起来。","img":"images/449704/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出锅放入少许猪油，或者香油，撒上葱花即可。","img":"images/449704/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"嫩嫩滑滑的，特别好吃哦。","img":"images/449704/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}